FunctionAttrs: check all uses when inferring captures for argument SCCs

Code change of llvm/llvm-project#231536 (05b3eeffba), on main since
2026-10-13 and not in 23.1.5. Without it an argument SCC can get a false
captures(none), and TinyGo then puts an escaping allocation on the stack.

diff --git a/llvm/lib/Transforms/IPO/FunctionAttrs.cpp b/llvm/lib/Transforms/IPO/FunctionAttrs.cpp
index 1441c660abbd21..ac7ae381b1b574 100644
--- a/llvm/lib/Transforms/IPO/FunctionAttrs.cpp
+++ b/llvm/lib/Transforms/IPO/FunctionAttrs.cpp
@@ -1368,7 +1368,6 @@ static void addArgumentAttrs(const SCCNodeSet &SCCNodes,
           CC |= Use->CC;
         else
           CC |= CaptureComponents(A->getAttributes().getCaptureInfo());
-        break;
       }
       if (capturesAll(CC))
         break;
